WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:10.248
On the morning of the wedding, after washing your face, apply just three things generously: toner, lotion, and essence, and let them absorb.

2
00:00:10.584 --> 00:00:17.880
The trick is to pat it in with your fingertips rather than rubbing, repeating that patting technique to hydrate deep into the skin.

3
00:00:18.216 --> 00:00:23.736
The most important thing to avoid is nutrient cream, sunscreen, or facial oil.

4
00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:28.752
Depending on the formula, these can cause pilling on the skin.

5
00:00:29.088 --> 00:00:35.448
If pilling happens, you may have to wash your face and start over, wasting precious makeup time.

6
00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:43.992
The products the artist uses already contain enough sun protection, so just focus on keeping your skin light and hydrated.
